{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_03_end","storyGroup":"act42side","storySort":1,"storyDependence":"act42side_level_act42side_03_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"MT-3","storyName":"礼拜","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"调查爆炸案的蕾缪安跟着线索追查到了育婴圣堂，但牧首拒绝让她参与育婴圣堂的安防工作。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act42side/level_act42side_03_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act42side_03","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["蕾缪安","薇尔丽芙","牧首","保育员","席德佳","库兰塔","费德里科","领路的保育员"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_bg_61_g2_baptismlobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tech_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_sys_tech_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"薇尔丽芙枢机，好久不见。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"别叫枢机了，我现在只是育婴圣堂里一个再普通不过的事务员。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"那我叫你前辈喽......看起来，确实是前辈的手笔。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"什么？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我刚刚一路走来看见的，从外围街道到圣堂内部，这里安防布置的思路可不输戍卫队。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"总得帮着干点活儿嘛。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"说起来，还真被我猜对了。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"什么？","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"来这里确认防务的果然是你......从程序上讲这类工作明显更适合公证所的执行者，或是铳骑与戍卫队的成员。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我姑且也还在追查前两天的爆炸事件哦，不是什么无关人士。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"我可没接到通知说布防的时候要把爆炸案的调查结果也考虑在内。况且，你的调查现在也还没什么实质性的成果吧？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"难道说，你来这里，是因为受到袭击的是安多恩？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"前辈，你不会是想敲打我，身为七厅枢机，眼里应该是整座圣城，而不是自己的私交吧？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"哈，我们都知道你是什么样的人啦。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"头脑清醒，做事雷厉风行，又有敏锐准确的洞察力，在遴选枢机的时候确实加了很多分......","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"但大家也都清楚，你的这些美好品质，一般在什么时候最能体现出来。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"蕾缪安枢机，我还记得你当年加入戍卫队特勤队的初衷哦，我看过那份报告书。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"哈哈，是吗，我都忘了。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"你本来并没有加入特勤队的打算，只是去看望菲亚梅塔的，对吧？","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......还有安多恩。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"哦？这我倒是不知道。我以为你们是加入特勤队之后才认识的。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"要更早。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"l","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"他好像是从很远的地方一路走过来的，穿着一身破衣裳，憔悴得很。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"就那么一动不动地坐在礼拜堂前的长椅上，比路边的圣徒像更像圣徒像。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"那是我和莫斯提马第一次见到他。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"至于菲亚梅塔，本来就是我和莫斯提马在电影院午夜场偶然认识的好朋友。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"安多恩不在圣城长大，本身就格格不入；菲亚梅塔是个倔性子，那阵子大概在和她的爷爷置气......我和莫斯提马就想着去看看。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"这两人事先并不认识，其他的萨科塔也未必是故意排挤他们，但实际的结果是——","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"整个“软胶铳弹轮盘赌，暨特勤队组队仪式”，就只有这两个家伙孤零零地被剩了下来。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"所以你就把在场的其他人都痛扁了一顿......","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"又和莫斯提马当场填了申请表，跟他们组成了那次组队仪式的最后一个四人小队。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"最后成了整个特勤队出外勤次数最多、配合最为默契的小队，也才有了后来的意外......","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"蕾缪安，不论我再怎么欣赏你......我也还是要提醒你，身处枢机之位，做事的出发点就永远只有圣城。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"圣城在我眼里，首先是一个又一个熟悉的名字。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"前辈，怀旧到此为止。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"l","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"第七厅有能力审视自己的职责所在。如果前辈只以“普通的事务员”自居，我应该亲自去见一下牧首。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"......","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"l","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"她就在前面，对吧？","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":84},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":85},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":86},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfootstep","volume":"1","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_61_i06.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":89},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.15","yScaleFrom":"1.15","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"70","block":"false","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":93},{"type":"text","text":"蕾缪安见到了此行的目标。","id":94},{"type":"text","text":"金发萨科塔立于某道门廊之下，她在祷告，她在不安，她的呼吸急促，身体因此肉眼可见地颤栗着......","id":95},{"type":"text","text":"蕾缪安感觉自己快被对方汹涌的情绪淹没。","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"牧首？","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"——","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"蕾缪安枢机，我听到了你和薇尔丽芙的谈话......但请原谅我此刻无法思绪平静地与你交谈。","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"那里面是？","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"一位萨卡兹母亲。","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"她在荒野上耽搁了太久，来这里又拒食了两天......现在的情况不容乐观。我们的保育员正在为她治疗。","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"她在恐惧，她在焦躁，她不想输给疼痛，此刻仍在挣扎着保持清醒......","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"......她在清醒地祈祷，祈祷孩子能平安降生。","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"我能做的，只是与她感同身受，与她一同祈祷。","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"您能感受到萨卡兹的情绪？","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"是的，枢机。","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"就像此刻，你也在为我的悸动而担忧。它清晰得如同你我之间与生俱来的共感。","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"“共感”......","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"也许这是主对我这样一个目盲者额外的恩典，也许只是因为......这里是拉特兰专为创造新生而建的圣堂。","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"我们的信仰将在此夯实，在此延伸，这里不应有任何隔阂与限制。","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"这样说来，更应该走进这里的，是我们的同胞自己。","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......","id":113},{"type":"dialog","id":114},{"type":"text","text":"阳光从高处的彩窗落下，照亮空旷而肃穆的大堂。","id":115},{"type":"text","text":"巨大的圣像俯首合十，注视着下方两位渺小的萨科塔。","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"这里的确很特别。","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"见多了用各种奇怪的姿势举着铳蓄势待发的圣像，第一次见到这种造型的，还真是，唔，有些不太习惯......","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"相比于矗立在玻利瓦尔山间或伊比利亚海边的那些所谓的“拉特兰教造像”，拉特兰随处可见的圣像其实更难以理解，枢机。","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"乐园形塑了我们别样到有些失真的虔诚。","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"跋涉在天灾与苦难中的生灵，为生存祈愿......这才是信仰最初的形貌。","id":121},{"type":"dialog","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"image","id":126},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_61_i06","id":127},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_bg_61_g2_baptismlobby.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":131},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1785_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"牧、牧首，一切平安。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"那位母亲的状态终于平复下来了，我们喂她吃了药，也给她补充了营养，此刻她已经睡去。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"呼——那我就放心了。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"她分娩在即，还请继续关注她的状况，不得有一丝松懈。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1785_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"是。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":143},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"感恩主的赐福。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我能感受到，您发自内心的释然与喜悦。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"也感谢你的陪伴，枢机。希望共感没有让我的不安影响到你。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"不会，我没那么脆弱啦。再说，您刚刚的话对我也有一些启发。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"听您刚刚说起......您好像是后面才来到这里？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"是的。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"我曾在荒野间踟蹰良久，我的同行者们凋敝于泥污......","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"为了找到拉特兰？","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"不，彼时我从未想过，大地上会出现这样一座城市。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"但共同的愿景，让我终于找到了它的位置。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"我们能在此时此刻相遇，这是被写就的命运，枢机。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"所幸过了这么久，以我之残躯，仍然能为拉特兰、为我的族人们做一点事情。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我的一位朋友，他也在这座圣堂中工作，他也是从遥远的地方来到这里......","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"如今的拉特兰，未来的拉特兰，每一个人都必须，也能够找到自己的位置，发挥各自的作用......由此，我们才能对抗灾异。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"扯远啦。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"既然出现了针对保育员的袭击事件，第七厅愿意协助育婴圣堂开展安防工作，确保降生仪式顺利进行。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"......","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"枢机，我理解你对朋友的担忧，也理解你对这座圣堂的好奇......","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"但如我方才所说，我们每个人都应在各自的位置，发挥各自的作用。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"呀，本来我还以为我们聊得挺开心的。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"但结果是......我被无情地拒绝了，对吧？","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":181},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"charslot","id":185},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_bg_39_g1_monasteryentrance.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":187},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":188,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"......节哀顺变啊，各位。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"早知道这里发生了这样的事情，出门时我应该带几株麦穗的。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"麦穗？","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"兰登修道院的葬礼会有些特别的仪式。我们会用麦穗编一顶发冠，放在死者的棺椁上。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"这样，他在彼岸也能闻到面包和啤酒的香味，灵魂就会得到抚慰。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"谢谢你，好心的修女。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"我和我的兄弟因为感染了矿石病，又没有参加骑士竞技的能力，只能被商业联合会驱逐，就这么流浪荒野。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"好不容易来到了拉特兰，可他却在这时候发病咽了气......想想也够倒霉的。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"不过，教皇厅帮我安葬了他。他死得还算体面......甚至还有一位路过的萨科塔为他演奏了哀歌。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"这样啊......","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"请确认，你所见的萨科塔，是否为黑色长直发，女性，所持的乐器是一架形制特殊的大提琴？","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"呃，是。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"她演奏了你们？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"在她的演奏过程中，你们是否感受到了幻觉，或者某种精神层面的不适？","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"不适是指？反正听得我挺想哭的，毕竟那是我的兄弟啊......","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"......","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"执行者先生，不是说好了，我来负责打探......","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"公证所的其他执行者很快就会接这批流浪者到安布罗修区的安置点，我们的时间本就不多。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"流浪者也并非嫌犯，我不觉得有对他们使用迂回的询问策略的必要。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"以前为了给兰登修道院做宣传，我去过龙门，也去过维多利亚......我经常见到这样的人。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"因为种种不幸的遭遇，他们才离开自己的国家。他们大多和警察打过交道，对警察的态度都很......","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"执行者相当于警察，对吧？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"呃，没有必要啦，毕竟你们刚收留了我们这些异族的感染者。好像以前你们自己的公民感染了矿石病，都是要被赶走的。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"所以我现在对拉特兰官方的印象还不错，再说这位小哥也一身正气......","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"......","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"......","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"至于你们刚刚想问的那位黑发萨科塔，她有什么问题吗？","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"该萨科塔目前处于受监管状态。她擅自从修道院离开，我们一路调查她的行踪来到这里。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"她、她是囚犯？我还以为她是你们第六厅的公务员呢。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"你依据什么作出这样的判断？","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"葬礼结束后，她向我们确认了修道院的情况——有没有哪些设施年久失修，存不存在安全隐患，有没有急缺的物资之类的。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"哦对了，她还专门问过，最近刚到拉特兰的人里，有没有谁突然不见了，尤其是孕妇......","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"（听起来，阿尔图罗小姐不像是偶然经过啊......）","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"......","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_bg_61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":258},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":259,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"怎么样？","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"何必问呢，前辈。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"牧首的意思，当然和你差不多嘛——“别多管闲事”。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"哈哈。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"蕾缪安，我知道你是好心，不过你这是对我的不信任哦。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"前辈，还请你理解。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"育婴圣堂，这座不知从何时起就睥睨着拉特兰城的巨构......","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"不论是你、帕特里奇昂阁下，还是那位牧首，都许诺未来将从此处诞生。就连那位制造爆炸的“嫌犯”，似乎也对它颇有兴趣。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"你一定比我更理解，负责情报与国安的第七厅，怎么能忽视这样万众瞩目的焦点呢？","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"理解理解。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"charslot","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1785_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领路的保育员","text":"麻烦让一下。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"charslot","id":285},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfootstep","volume":"1","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_001","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_932_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_003","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#1$5","afrom":"0","ato":"1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","duration":"1","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1255_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":302},{"type":"charslot","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"保育员领着一队人经过，脚步声敲醒了空旷的启圣大堂。","id":304},{"type":"text","text":"队伍中的人来自不同种族，没有一个人说话，但所有人都在好奇地打量着这个陌生的空间。","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"蕾缪安连忙侧身让开。","id":306},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"怎么了，蕾缪安枢机？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......没什么。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我是想说，好奇心害死菲林，我要是继续坚持，就该吃前辈的投诉了。","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":319},{"type":"image","id":320},{"type":"charslot","id":321}],"characters":["蕾缪安","薇尔丽芙","牧首","保育员","席德佳","库兰塔","费德里科","领路的保育员"]}